     9	| [cc·cx] m10·m15 앵커 무효화 | **닫힘** | 두 앵커 재조준과 전수 1회 매치 확인이 명시됐다([설계:107](/Users/kty/Downloads/kty-claude-harness-template/_workspace/00_design-reference-gate.md:107), [설계:331](/Users/kty/Downloads/kty-claude-harness-template/_workspace/00_design-reference-gate.md:331)). |
